    "problem_statement": "Current research lacks a comprehensive understanding of how specific environmental factors, particularly the prevalence of fast-paced environments, contribute to ADHD development. While some studies have examined the impact of screen time or chaotic home environments, a broader assessment of the cumulative effect of a consistently fast-paced lifestyle is needed.",
