      "validation": "The scale will undergo pilot testing and validation to ensure its reliability and validity."
    },
    "data_analysis": "Statistical analyses will include: descriptive statistics, correlation analyses, multiple regression analyses to examine the relationship between fast-paced environment exposure and ADHD outcomes, controlling for potential confounding variables (e.g., socioeconomic status, parental mental health, genetics). Moderation analyses will be conducted to assess the role of these factors."
